        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-MDS3RDDSBR, Back-to-Back Pair of Large Pineapple Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEchoing the beautiful styling known best in Palm Springs, the Large Pineapple Door Handles are a great way to add a tropical, yet glamorous addition to your home or office. The Large Pineapple Back-to-Back Door Handle is available in either 19 inch or 24 inch lengths. It comes packaged as a back-to-back pair--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes (not pictured).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/large-pineapple-door-handle-first-impressions-mds3rddsbr\"><b>First Impressions Model MDS3RDDSBR</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Series 3 Pull Pair:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pineapple-handle-details.jpg?v=1704354555\"><b>Detailed First Impressions MDS3RDDSBR Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-MDS03-specifications.pdf?v=1704262247\"><b>First Impressions PR-MDS3RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PR-MDS3019RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PR-MDS0243RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This First Impressions door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including different center to center mounting distances and  <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable ore Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Pineapple Door Handles",
                "description": "Echoing the beautiful styling known best in Palm Springs, the Large Pineapple Door Handles are a great way to add a tropical, yet glamorous addition to your home or office. The Large Pineapple Back-to-Back Door Handle is available in either 19 inch or 24 inch lengths. It comes packaged as a back-to-back pair--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes.",
